  "cells": [
    {
      "cell_type": "markdown",
      "source": [
        "**Architecture 2: ResNet-18 transfer-learning baseline**\n",
        "\n",
        "ImageNet-pretrained ResNet-18 is fine-tuned on the four CelebA identities. This notebook reads data/splits.csv and uses the same transforms, data split, seeds, training protocol, and evaluation artifacts as Third_Variant.ipynb, so its results can be compared directly. Run cells from top to bottom. Results are written to results/resnet18_ft/ and the selected checkpoint to checkpoints/resnet18_ft.pt. The first model build downloads ImageNet weights if they are not already cached.\n",
        "\n",
        "**0. Environment setup**\n",
        "On Colab, select a GPU runtime for faster training. By default, the repository is cloned to Google Drive so checkpoints persist. Locally, start Jupyter inside this repository or a child directory."
      ],
      "metadata": {
        "id": "YxBH9dHpZDMH"
      }
    },
    {
      "cell_type": "code",
      "execution_count": 2,
      "metadata": {
        "colab": {
          "base_uri": "https://localhost:8080/"
        },
        "id": "jZImFBI37Fy5",
        "outputId": "2f81c8a0-f0b9-4f1f-ba35-f4460738b345"
      },
      "outputs": [
        {
          "output_type": "stream",
          "name": "stdout",
          "text": [
            "Mounted at /content/drive\n",
            "Project root: /content/drive/MyDrive/IE7615-Group3-Project1\n",
            "PyTorch 2.11.0+cpu | device: cpu\n"
          ]
        }
      ],
      "source": [
        "import os, sys, subprocess\n",
        "from pathlib import Path\n",
        "\n",
